    "description": "Multi-mission water-surface slope time series across the Ebro river basin, produced by DTU Space, Denmark, for EO4FLOOD. The basin-wide Parquet file contains multiple river reaches and virtual stations. slope_grid and slopesd_grid describe water-surface slope and its standard deviation along a reach; slope_vs and slopesd_vs give the corresponding values at a virtual station, in centimetres per kilometre. chainage is distance along a reach in metres, time is encoded as decimal years, and lon and lat locate reach nodes in geographic degrees.",
